          "type": "text",
          "text": "Survey crew considered a strict material budget while preparing a capacity check for the robotics club prototype. The prototype must pass through the laboratory doorway. The design must also be explained clearly in the safety briefing. A right pyramid has a rectangular base 8 cm by 7 cm and perpendicular height 15 cm. Find its volume in cm³."
        }
      ],
      "marks": 2,
      "primary_outcome": "5.6",
      "secondary_outcomes": [],
      "response": {
        "type": "numeric",
        "comparison_mode": "exact_numeric",
        "canonical_answer": "280",
        "canonical_latex": "280",
        "accepted_answers": [],
        "absolute_tolerance": null,
        "rounding_precision": null,
        "unit": null
      },
      "hints": [
        {
          "stage": 1,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "First calculate the rectangular base area."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "stage": 2,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Use V = 1/3 × (8 × 7) × 15."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "solution": [
        {
